<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Riksbank leaves repo rate at 4.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Riksbank leaves repo rate at 4.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Tuesday it would leave its key one-week repurchase rate at an unchanged fixed 4.10 percent.  </p>
<p>The repo runs from May 7 and May 14.</p>
<p>The decision to keep the repo unchanged was in line with market expectations.</p>
<p>The Riksbank has not cut the repo rate since December 17. The bank's deposit rate currently stands at 3.75 percent and the lending rate at 5.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
